        "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T02:20:35.006Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you’re a Google AI Pro or Google AI Ultra subscriber, your membership already comes with recurring monthly Google Cloud credits through the Google Developer Program .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-cloud-credits-gdp-ai-studio/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T02:20:35.006Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Google Developer Program is a no-cost membership unifying tools, learning paths, and perks across AI Studio, Google Cloud, Firebase, Android, and more.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-cloud-credits-gdp-ai-studio/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T02:20:35.006Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "An active profile is required for Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers to access developer benefits like monthly Google Cloud credits, higher Google Antigravity quotas, and Google Skills credits.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-cloud-credits-gdp-ai-studio/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-14T02:20:35.006Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Google AI Pro and Ultra plans include recurring monthly Google Cloud credits that you can put straight toward Gemini API usage for prompting, building, and deploying AI-powered apps from Google AI Studio.",
